("16042","1871","888","902,905,911","(f·g)(x) = (x² ­ 2x + 4)(2x+8)
\n         =2x³+8x²­2x²-16x+8x+32
\n(f·g)(-2)=2(-2)³+8(-2)²-2(2)²-16(-2)+8(-2)²
\n         = -16+32-8+32-16+32
\n         = 56
\n|=>(f+g)(x) 		= (5x²+7)+(4x²-3x-5)
\n          		= 9x²-3x+2
\n3(f+g)(x)	= 9(3)²-3(3)+2
\n		=81-9+2
\n		=24
\n(f-g)(x)		=(5x²+7)+(4x²-3x-5)
\n		=x²+3x+2
\n-2(f-g)(x)	= (-2)²+3(-2)+2
\n		=4-6+2
\n		= 0
\n|=>4x²+10/x²+2²
\n= 4x²+10/x²+4
\n= 4x^4+10/x^2 +4x^2
\n= (4x^4+4x^2+10)/x^2 
\n
