("16728","1570","900","1302,1303,1304,1305,1306","ตอบ y = d (x-3) ให้ k เป็นค่าคงที่
\ny = k (x-3) 
\n10 = k (5-3) 
\n10 = 2k 
\nก.k = 5
\n   y = 5 (x-3) 
\nข.แทนค่า x = 48
\ny = 5 (48-3) 
\ny = 5 (45) 
\ny = 225
\n
\n|=>ตอบ
\nE = IR 
\n    = (0.56 x 〖10〗^(-3)) (2.2 x 〖10〗^3)
\n    = 0.56 x 2.2
\n    = 1.232 v.
\nI   = E/R
\n    = (1.232 v.)/(260 Ω)
\n    = 0.0047 A
\n    = 4.7 mA
\n|=>ตอบ
\n  x^8  (x^2 y^(-4) z^(-6) ) ^(-4)(z^0  y^4 )                 
\n= x^8 (x^(2x(-4)〖x y〗^(-4x(-4)) 〖x z〗^(-6x(-4)( 1 y^4 )   
\n                                                
\n	
\n=〖 x〗^8  (x^(-8) y^16 z^24 )(  y^4 )
\n
\n					 
\n =  x^(-8+8)- y^(16-4)- Z^24
\n                                             
\n  
\n =  x^0x y^12  x Z^24  
\n
\n= y^12  x Z^24
\n
\n
\n|=>ตอบ〖3x〗^2- 4x+1
\n(3x - 1) (x - 1) = 0  หรือ x–1 = 0
\n3x = -1                      x = 1
\nx = - 1/3
\n|=>ตอบ
\nb^2= (6.6)² - (3)²
\n     = 43.56-9
\n     = b^2= 34.56
\n     = b = 5.86
\n","","","1"),
